--------------------------------------------------------------------------
LV2
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

The plugin build compiles against the LV2 headers. They are not vendored here -
`make lv2` uses the system's, and says so plainly when there are none.

    Copyright (c) 2006-2020 Steve Harris, David Robillard and others
    ISC licence

LV2 was chosen over VST because Steinberg's VST2 SDK has not been licensable
since 2018 and VST3 cannot be loaded by the host this targets. No Steinberg
code or headers are used anywhere in this project.

