--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Everything else
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

The synthesis, the module set, the rack, the cable physics and the interface
are original work. The ladder filter is built from the published literature on
topology-preserving transform filter design rather than from anyone's source;
the polyBLEP and polyBLAMP corrections likewise come from the published
band-limited-waveform literature. Neither is a port of an existing
implementation.

The BENCO wordmark and the character S. Tarr are brand assets of BENCO
Holdings, included here for use by this program.
